.git
.github
**/.next
**/node_modules
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/dist-bundle
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
tmp
**/tmp
*.zip
*.log
infra/compose.dev.local.yaml

# Secrets. Next's standalone output copies apps/web/.env into the runtime image, so a
# local `docker build` from a working copy would otherwise ship real credentials.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.dev.vars

# Wrangler caches and deploy bundles (the edge workers are not part of this image).
**/.wrangler
apps/edge/.wrangler-*
.tmp-edge-dist

# Local-only directories that are not part of the build.
.cursor
design
legacy-shortky
